%!PS
% Source for notice.pdf: a bold phrase inside a regular paragraph, and a
% fully bold line. Rebuild with:
%   ps2pdf -sPAPERSIZE=a4 tests/fixtures/notice.ps tests/fixtures/notice.pdf

/Helvetica-Bold findfont 11 scalefont setfont
72 760 moveto (PLEASE TAKE NOTICE) show
/Helvetica findfont 11 scalefont setfont
( that Special Meetings of the Board of Trustees will take place) show
72 746 moveto (on the dates and locations noted below.) show

/Helvetica-Bold findfont 11 scalefont setfont
72 714 moveto (BY ORDER OF THE MAYOR OF THE VILLAGE) show
showpage
